---
title: "Effects"
description: "Shadows and opacity."
section: Utilities
sectionOrder: 3
order: 8
---

`--shadow` takes a size by name (`md`) at any tier, a token, or any box-shadow; it never removes a primitive's focus ring. `--shadow-hue` tints every shadow in a subtree. `--opacity` fades the whole element; for a translucent fill, see `--bg-alpha`.

